          "top": "298px",
          "width": "654px",
          "height": "344px",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": "8",
          "overflow": "visible",
          "type": "table",
          "innerHTML": "<table class=\"op-tbl op-d-paper opp-sand op-nohead op-flat\" data-op-table=\"paper:sand\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; font-size:13px; font-family:'Crimson Text', Georgia, serif; --op-a:#fdf8ee; --op-b:#fdf8ee; --op-l:rgba(146,64,14,0.18); --op-x:#92400e; --op-h:#fdf8ee; --op-hf:#7f1d1d; --op-hl:#92400e; --op-t:#292524;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:84%;\" /><col style=\"width:16%;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><div style=\"font-family:'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#292524;\">Roasted Kabocha Squash Veloute <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#92400e; font-weight:700;\">(V, GF)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:'Crimson Text', Georgia, serif; font-size:12.5px; color:#57534e; font-style:italic; margin-top:2px;\">Brown-butter pepitas, sage oil, and creme fraiche</div></td><td class=\"op-num op-bold\">$14</td></tr><tr><td><div style=\"font-family:'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#292524;\">Wild Chanterelle &amp; Brioche Tart <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#92400e; font-weight:700;\">(V)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:'Crimson Text', Georgia, serif; font-size:12.5px; color:#57534e; font-style:italic; margin-top:2px;\">Caramelized shallot confit, aged Gruyere, lemon thyme</div></td><td class=\"op-num op-bold\">$18</td></tr><tr><td><div style=\"font-family:'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#292524;\">Crisp Duck Confit Rillettes</div><div style=\"font-family:'Crimson Text', Georgia, serif; font-size:12.5px; color:#57534e; font-style:italic; margin-top:2px;\">Pickled blackberries, coarse mustard, toasted country sourdough</div></td><td class=\"op-num op-bold\">$21</td></tr><tr><td><div style=\"font-family:'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#292524;\">Heirloom Beet &amp; Citrus Carpaccio <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#92400e; font-weight:700;\">(VG, GF)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:'Crimson Text', Georgia, serif; font-size:12.5px; color:#57534e; font-style:italic; margin-top:2px;\">Pistachio dukkah, blood orange segments, micro arugula</div></td><td class=\"op-num op-bold\">$16</td></tr><tr><td><div style=\"font-family:'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#292524;\">Charred Octopus &amp; Fennel <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#92400e; font-weight:700;\">(GF)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:'Crimson Text', Georgia, serif; font-size:12.5px; color:#57534e; font-style:italic; margin-top:2px;\">Smoked paprika emulsion, crispy capers, fingerling coins</div></td><td class=\"op-num op-bold\">$22</td></tr></tbody></table>",
